{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cGLBKPMxeD1795564247.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>希音將支付1億美元，以解決一宗在美國涉及欺騙消費者的訴訟。</p><p></p><p>美國聯邦貿易委員會公布，希音將支付1億美元作為向消費者的賠償，以和解一宗訴訟。美國聯邦貿易委員會指，這家快時尚零售商未能履行出貨承諾、壓制負面評論，並就供應鏈及棉花來源作出欺騙性宣稱，全部違反法律。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:43:53.490863+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T23:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:35.922819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:37:17.214213+00:00","content_hash":"5c8e84df8e5253c293139cffa36ff72d112fe4222c4ba95973a3e96fc10ba767","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:43:53.490863+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}